2026-11-27T10:19:40.0687123Z -- #369/#370/#1738 — the duplication window can fire, and --record refuses a laundered regression
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0687333Z   ok   a copy in ANOTHER module is one copy, whatever its locals are called (#1738 a)
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0687503Z   ok   a third copy costs one more, not two more: copies, not pairs
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0687761Z   ok   a re-wrap or a comment moves nothing: the window is the AST, not the lines
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0687931Z   ok   the node floor holds: two short shared statements are not a copy
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0688109Z   ok   the shipped window is 2 statements of at least 30 nodes (#1738)
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0688318Z   ok   regression_rows names the metric that moved the wrong way, old and new (#370)
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0688528Z   ok   cross_seam_edges moving up IS a regression row: the retired ratio's band is gone
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0688747Z   ok   --record REFUSES a worsened metric by default and leaves the table untouched
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0688954Z   ok   an explicit --allow-regression reason lets it through and writes the new value
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0689156Z   ok   a blank reason is refused, so the flag cannot decay into pasted boilerplate
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0689374Z   ok   a pure tightening still records with no flag -- that is the point of the exercise
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0689563Z   ok   and the path that proceeds still stamps a resolvable recorded_at (#363)
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0689744Z   ok   cross_seam_edges is recorded like every other row -- a tightening lands
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0689939Z   ok   --allow-regression is a flag that demands a reason, not a bare switch
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0689945Z 
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0690231Z -- #350/#374 — an improvement must be recorded, and the worst method has a budget
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0690441Z   ok   improvement_rows names every metric with headroom, budget and measured (#350)
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0690734Z   ok   and is the exact mirror of regression_rows: a worsening is not an improvement
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0690899Z   ok   a level metric is neither an improvement nor a regression
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0691095Z   ok   no metric is exempt from the ratchet: the two retired categories are gone
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0691294Z   ok   improvement_rows names cross_seam_edges like any other row when it falls
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0691482Z   ok   the ratchet FAILS on an improvement instead of printing a note (#350)
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0691698Z   ok   and the improvement block names all three, so the author knows what to write down
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0691862Z   ok   and prints the exact runnable command, not just the numbers
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0692039Z   ok   and frames it as 'you made this better, write it down', not as a breach
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0692251Z   ok   a zero-headroom tree still passes silently -- eleven of the last eighteen commits
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0692391Z   ok   a worsening still fails, and still as a breach
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0692606Z   ok   headroom on cross_seam_edges alone is an unrecorded improvement, so the run fails
2026-11-27T10:19:40.0692793Z   ok   an unrecorded improvement is not a violation at the exit code (#808)
